sequenceDiagram
    participant Excel as 🟢 Excel PivotTable
    participant XMLA as 🔵 XMLA Layer
    participant Parser as MDX Parser
    participant Semantic as Semantic Layer
    participant Plan as QueryPlan
    participant Model as SemanticModel
    participant DuckDB as DuckDB
    participant Builder as Cellset Builder

    Excel->>XMLA: DrilldownMember(CrossJoin(...), excluded, hierarchy)
    XMLA->>Parser: parse MDX text
    Parser-->>Semantic: ParsedMdx { has_drilldown_member, excluded set, ... }

    Semantic->>Semantic: classify → DrilldownMemberProbe
    Semantic->>Semantic: parse axis_dimensions (preserve order)
    Semantic->>Semantic: parse_excluded_members (dimension-tagged)
    Semantic-->>Plan: SemanticQuery { axis_dimensions, excluded_members, ... }

    Plan->>Plan: plan_from_semantic → GroupBy { dims, filters }
    Plan->>Model: get physical field mappings
    Model-->>Plan: DimensionDef, MeasureDef

    Plan->>Plan: sql_for_query_plan → SQL text
    Plan->>DuckDB: execute SQL
    DuckDB-->>Plan: QueryResult::Pairs(rows)

    Plan-->>Builder: QueryResult + SemanticQuery

    Builder->>Builder: map_pair_values (axis order)
    Builder->>Builder: identify excluded members by dimension
    Builder->>Builder: build collapsed tuples (ordered_pair)
    Builder->>Builder: render cellset XML

    Builder-->>Excel: 🔵 XMLA mddataset response
